# Graphometer Workbench — per-machine configuration.
#
# Copy this file to `graphometer.env` (same folder as start.sh). It is read by
# the server at startup; real environment variables win over lines here. The
# real file is gitignored — it describes YOUR machine, and it never ships.

# The port. 4311 is the default.
#STUDIO_PORT=4311

# The workspace root: the folder-picker's home. Pick the folder your projects
# live under; the picker always opens here and pins it as a chip.
#STUDIO_BROWSE_ROOT=/home/you/projects

# Folders the app must never list or open, comma-separated absolute paths.
# The exclusion applies to every path-accepting route, not only the picker.
#STUDIO_EXCLUDED_DIRS=/home/you/private,/home/you/secrets

# Default folder for a session when none is chosen. Defaults to the app's own
# studio/scratch/ sandbox folder.
#STUDIO_CWD=/home/you/projects/sandbox

# Development surfaces (raw /bridge wire view, Shell inspector tab). Off in a
# normal run; set to exactly 1 to enable.
#STUDIO_DEV=1
